,"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"(Alfred Stieglitz, New York, NY); Dr. Leo Stieglitz, New York, NY, 1920s; Descended in family; (Doris Bry, New York, NY); (Joan T. Washburn, New York, NY) (Source: Lynes, 1999)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Blue Sea with Rocks, 1922. Pastel on paper, 19 x 25 inches. Minneapolis Institute of Arts. © Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Whitney Archive indicates, \"Ptd. about 1923.\" Whitney Archive, Abiquiú Notebooks indicate, \"Sold to Dr. Leo Stieglitz.\" O'Keeffe visited York Beach, Maine, which served as inspiration for this piece, several times in the 1920s. Pictured in 1923 New York (Anderson) Stieglitz installation photograph, see Appendix III, figure 13. See cat. nos. 382–87. (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Pastel. Rocky pieces of land extend into a bright blue sea. The larger landform extends from the right edge of the composition to its center. On the left, two bits of land are visible. The ocean is calm, and no waves are visible.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Pastel on paper","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"19 x 25 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/793704/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/793704"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}